OL,3,GNEWSASwimarathon involves 1,500 people
OL,4,Aand raises #70k
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #70,000 has been raised for
OL,7,Fcharity after about 1,500 people took
OL,8,Fpart in a swimarathon.
OL,10,FBetween them, the swimmers in Guernsey
OL,11,Fcovered more than 366 miles (590km) at
OL,12,FBeau Sejour, and during the inaugural
OL,13,FSalty Swimarathon at La Vallette
OL,14,FBathing Pools, earlier in October.
OL,16,FThe main beneficiary is Les Bourgs
OL,17,FHospice, which provides specialist
OL,18,Fpalliative care to patients and support
OL,19,Ffor their families.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
