OL,3,GNEWSASwimarathon involves 1,500 people
OL,4,Aand raises #70k
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Stuart, chair of the swimarathon
OL,7,Forganising committee, said they were
OL,8,F"utterly delighted" at the success of
OL,9,Fthe swim. Organisers said they would
OL,10,Frelease the final total at a later date
OL,11,Fonce all donations were in.
